info = "[center]Oh hey there, my name is Herald Tango and i happen to be a combat trainer.
I'm currently here on vacation but my combat senses are becoming way to dull from not doing anything.
If you are up for it let me take you on a training duel, it will be beneficial to both of us and I'll even throw in a little bonus. [/center]"
